FullPanel is an independent implementation of a self-hosted application
control panel. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Easypanel.

Public Easypanel documentation and a locally inspected distribution informed
functional specifications. The application is an original implementation;
Easypanel executable code and extracted runtime/UI assets are not distributed
as part of the FullPanel application.

The repository does include three attributed historical Easypanel screenshots
for comparative documentation, also reproduced in the specifications DOCX.
See docs/images/reference/README.md for their provenance. These third-party
images are not FullPanel UI assets and are not offered under this project's
Apache-2.0 license. Their rights remain with their respective holders; no
express republication permission is recorded in the repository notices.

The provenance record is not a comparative source-code audit or evidence of
a strictly separated clean-room process. It provides no legal conclusion or
guarantee concerning third-party rights.

Third-party packages retain their own licenses. See package-lock.json and
the licenses distributed with each package.

The current application bundles Inter under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Its notice and complete license are in public/licenses/Inter-OFL.txt. The
earlier DM Sans and Manrope license notices are retained in public/licenses/;
they are not the current UI font selection. No remote font service is
required at runtime.
